      "title": "dot11decrypt: Fix reading out of bounds if MAC header is short",
      "message": "dot11decrypt: Fix reading out of bounds if MAC header is short\n\nCurrently, we are not checking if the MAC header is long enough when\ngetting STA/BSSID and this could lead to accessing buffer out of bounds.\n\nFix this by checking length before attempting to access.\nSince we are not accessing addr4, use DOT11DECRYPT_MAC_FRAME instead.\n\nSigned-off-by: Chien Wong <m@xv97.com>\n(cherry picked from commit cfc4c2e6783e22493bdf5c16c38eb7a54a01625a)\n",
